{{ define "common.prerequisites" -}}
## Prerequisites
* Kubernetes 1.28+
* Kubectl 1.28+
* Helm 3.1.0+
{{- end }}

{{ define "common.prerequisiteswithpv" -}}
{{ template "common.prerequisites" . }}
* PV provisioner support in the underlying infrastructure
{{- end }}

{{ define "common.prerequisiteswithhpa" -}}
{{ template "common.prerequisites" . }}
* [metrics-server](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/metrics-server) is required in the cluster when HPA is enabled (`hpa.enabled=true`)
{{- end }}

{{ define "common.prerequisiteswithgatewayapi" -}}
{{ template "common.prerequisites" . }}
* The Gateway API CRDs, a Gateway Controller, and the parent Gateway `radar-base-k8s-gateway` are required when `gatewayAPI.enabled=true`; these can be installed via the [gateway-api](https://github.com/RADAR-base/radar-helm-charts/tree/main/charts/gateway-api) chart
{{- end }}

